{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/pulls/12029", "id": 1608049682, "node_id": "PR_kwDOATCU_c5f2OQS", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/pinot/pull/12029", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/pinot/pull/12029.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/pinot/pull/12029.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/issues/12029", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/pulls/12029/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/pulls/12029/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/issues/12029/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/statuses/a68a80cb222004c5e7b4990763ba185e96af0fc7", "number": 12029, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "fix by checking the index first", "user": {"login": "Nemesis123925", "id": 60150622, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTUwNjIy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60150622?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925", "html_url": "https://github.com/Nemesis123925", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## Setup:\r\nJava version: openjdk 11.0.20.1\r\nMaven version: Apache Maven 3.8.1\r\n\r\n## Fixed Test:\r\n`org.apache.pinot.core.transport.server.routing.stats.ServerRoutingStatsManagerTest.testQuerySubmitAndCompletionStats`\r\n\r\n## Test Failure:\r\nThe test's `List<Pair<String, Integer>>` generated by `fetchNumInFlightRequestsForAllServers()`, `fetchEMALatencyForAllServers()`, and `fetchHybridScoreForAllServers()` shows non-determinism with the order of `Pair<String, Integer>` when applying the `NonDex` tool. Although the content of the Assertion is all correct, the assertion could assert on wrong index in the `List` due to the non-determinism in the `List`. One example could be the `List` contatins `{Pair(\"server1\", 1), Pair(\"server2\", 2)}`, but the assertion assert that the `List` is `{Pair(\"server2\", 2), Pair(\"server1\", 1)}`.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause:\r\nThe root cause is in the `ConcurrentHashMap` used by [`ServerRoutingStatsManager.java`'s `_serverQueryStatsMap`](https://github.com/apache/pinot/blob/7217bb9d16b60074c1e9a9df72984556a7c8dbd5/pinot-core/src/main/java/org/apache/pinot/core/transport/server/routing/stats/ServerRoutingStatsManager.java#L50), which got iterated to create the `List` using the `entrySet()` function in [`fetchNumInFlightRequestsForAllServers`](https://github.com/apache/pinot/blob/7217bb9d16b60074c1e9a9df72984556a7c8dbd5/pinot-core/src/main/java/org/apache/pinot/core/transport/server/routing/stats/ServerRoutingStatsManager.java#L248), [`fetchEMALatencyForAllServers`](https://github.com/apache/pinot/blob/7217bb9d16b60074c1e9a9df72984556a7c8dbd5/pinot-core/src/main/java/org/apache/pinot/core/transport/server/routing/stats/ServerRoutingStatsManager.java#L293), and [`fetchHybridScoreForAllServers`](https://github.com/apache/pinot/blob/7217bb9d16b60074c1e9a9df72984556a7c8dbd5/pinot-core/src/main/java/org/apache/pinot/core/transport/server/routing/stats/ServerRoutingStatsManager.java#L339). The `List<Pair<String, Interger>>` created is directly returned to the `testQuerySubmitAndCompletionStats`, which cause the order's non-determinism in the `List`.\r\n\r\n## Fix:\r\nSince the specific part suffering from the non-determinism here only have two elements in the `List`, the fix here is to first found the element's index (`0` or `1`) before asserting them. This eleminates the non-determinism here without modifing the source code in `main` folder.", "labels": [{"id": 3428478178, "node_id": "LA_kwDOATCU_c7MWmzi", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/pinot/labels/flaky-test", "name": "flaky-test", "description": "Tracks a test that intermittently fails", "color": "1d76db", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2023-11-19T19:36:43Z", "updated_at": "2023-11-20T19:19:14Z", "closed_at": "2023-11-20T19:19:14Z", "merged_at": "2023-11-20T19:19:14Z", "merge_commit_sha": "61556af200a53097133de45a701a2890ac83f662", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "Nemesis123925:fix-flaky-ServerRoutingStatsManagerTest", "ref": "fix-flaky-ServerRoutingStatsManagerTest", "repo": {"id": 702670318, "node_id": "R_kgDOKeHl7g", "name": "pinot", "full_name": "Nemesis123925/pinot", "owner": {"login": "Nemesis123925", "id": 60150622, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTUwNjIy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60150622?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925", "html_url": "https://github.com/Nemesis123925", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Nemesis123925/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users